  "prefLabel": "En 1502.30 Utility line",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.30 \"Utility line\" means the pipeline, cable, communication line, or conduit, or a line of poles, towers, or other structures and wires and fixtures thereon, regardless of whether it is owned or utilized by a utility, other entity, or individual.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
